    <comment>Update to 1.5.1. Also re-enables the chat-model unit test module that was fully ignored for a single function-level langchain-tests import; 503 tests pass per flavour, rpmlint 0 badness.</comment>
    <requestid>1371289</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="10" vrev="2">
